# HLS 广告过滤关键词文件 — 实时代理专用
# HLS ad-filter keyword file — used by the real-time /proxy endpoint
#
# 使用说明 / Usage:
#   • 每行一个关键词（区分大小写，子串匹配）
#     One keyword per line (case-sensitive, substring match against the segment URI)
#   • 以 # 开头的行为注释，空行忽略
#     Lines starting with # are comments; blank lines are ignored
#   • 以 re: 开头的行将被解析为正则表达式
#     Lines prefixed with re: are compiled as regular expressions
#   • 若此文件不存在，代理将回退使用 config/blacklist.txt 中的关键词
#     If this file is absent, the proxy falls back to keywords in config/blacklist.txt
#
# 启用方法 / How to activate:
#   将此文件复制为 proxy_ad_filter.txt，然后取消注释或添加所需的关键词：
#   Copy this file to proxy_ad_filter.txt, then uncomment or add desired keywords:
#
#     cp config/proxy_ad_filter.txt.example config/proxy_ad_filter.txt
#
# 示例 / Examples (uncomment to enable):
# /ad/
# /advertisement/
# adbreak
# re:/(ads?|commercial)/
# re:\.ad\d+\.ts$
